   "content": "This Postgres query double-counts revenue when an order has several shipments: SELECT o.id, SUM(o.total) FROM orders o JOIN shipments s ON s.order_id = o.id GROUP BY o.id. How do I fix it without losing orders that have no shipments?",
   "tokens": null
