   "content": "The join repeats each order once per shipment, so SUM(o.total) counts it several times. Aggregate orders on their own and join shipments only for what you need: SELECT o.id, o.total, COUNT(s.id) AS shipments FROM orders o LEFT JOIN shipments s ON s.order_id = o.id GROUP BY o.id, o.total. The LEFT JOIN keeps orders with no shipments.",
